# Marketplays — Admin Portal

**Source of truth:** `docs/marketplays_cursor_rules.md` **Section 8** (+ always **Sections 1–2**). Schema: **Section 4**. State machine: **Section 5.2**.

## Hard rules
- Every mutating admin action writes an `audit_logs` row — no silent mutations
- CIS override sets `listings.is_cis_overridden = true` and shows an asterisk in admin UI
- Dispute resolutions only: Approve Seller (full payout) | Full Refund | Partial Refund (%)
- Suspended listings drop from buyer queries immediately; do not show suspension reason to sellers
